1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,610
More than one in four older adults fall each year, and less

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,180
than half tell their doctor.

3
00:00:05,651 --> 00:00:09,155
Meet Margaret, seventy-eight, on eight medicines, and her

4
00:00:09,155 --> 00:00:10,999
daughter Alex, both fictional.

5
00:00:10,999 --> 00:00:15,732
After urgent care started a new sleeping pill, Alex thinks Mom seems foggier.

6
00:00:15,732 --> 00:00:19,359
Kinwise helps families notice what changes after a medicine

7
00:00:19,359 --> 00:00:22,371
change, and bring a clear question to the doctor.

8
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,691
Margaret describes her day in her own words.

9
00:00:25,691 --> 00:00:28,589
A clinical language engine reads it on her device.

10
00:00:29,418 --> 00:00:33,101
Woozy becomes dizziness, nearly went over a near-fall, and

11
00:00:33,101 --> 00:00:34,943
no ankle swelling stays a no.

12
00:00:34,943 --> 00:00:37,737
Sofia's fall is set aside as someone else's.

13
00:00:37,737 --> 00:00:40,531
Margaret confirms each answer before saving.

14
00:00:41,299 --> 00:00:42,221
Alex signs in.

15
00:00:42,221 --> 00:00:46,042
Since lorazepam started, dizziness was recorded on 9 of 14

16
00:00:46,042 --> 00:00:48,941
answered days, compared with 2 of 19 before.

17
00:00:48,941 --> 00:00:52,827
One fall and two near-falls were recorded on those 14 days.

18
00:00:52,827 --> 00:00:56,714
It shows a change in what was recorded, not what caused it.

19
00:00:57,484 --> 00:01:01,139
The timeline compares answered days before and after, with

20
00:01:01,139 --> 00:01:03,534
Fisher's exact and Mann-Whitney tests.

21
00:01:03,534 --> 00:01:06,181
Falls are listed by date: too few to test.

22
00:01:06,951 --> 00:01:11,023
The review checks her eight medicines against AGS Beers 2023,

23
00:01:11,023 --> 00:01:15,295
anticholinergic burden, where she scores 7, fall-risk lists, and

24
00:01:15,295 --> 00:01:19,633
possible prescribing cascades, like furosemide for ankle swelling

25
00:01:19,633 --> 00:01:20,768
after amlodipine.

26
00:01:20,768 --> 00:01:25,374
Each finding ends in a sourced question for her doctor or pharmacist.

27
00:01:26,150 --> 00:01:29,337
Here the model's wording failed the source check, so code

28
00:01:29,337 --> 00:01:31,406
hides it and the original text stays.

29
00:01:32,175 --> 00:01:36,160
Before adding a medicine, Alex sees what would change: Advil PM

30
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:40,018
adds three review prompts, including a second diphenhydramine

31
00:01:40,018 --> 00:01:40,524
product.

32
00:01:40,524 --> 00:01:42,675
Nothing is saved until Alex saves.

33
00:01:43,612 --> 00:01:47,268
Ask Kinwise answers from the records: near-falls on 2 of 14

34
00:01:47,268 --> 00:01:49,622
answered days since lorazepam started.

35
00:01:49,622 --> 00:01:52,349
A plainer AI draft is checked by code first.

36
00:01:52,349 --> 00:01:56,252
Treatment questions are redirected to her doctor or pharmacist.

37
00:01:57,627 --> 00:02:00,245
The visit brief puts it on one page.

38
00:02:00,245 --> 00:02:04,535
Alex must mark it reviewed before it prints, and it exports

39
00:02:04,535 --> 00:02:07,589
as an HL7 FHIR R4 bundle of 270 resources.

40
00:02:08,853 --> 00:02:14,182
Both test suites rerun live: 94.2 percent micro-F1 on 70 held-out

41
00:02:14,182 --> 00:02:19,429
fictional diary stories, and 57 of 57 synthetic medication cases

42
00:02:19,429 --> 00:02:20,003
passed.

43
00:02:20,773 --> 00:02:24,335
All safety logic is deterministic code with cited sources;

44
00:02:24,335 --> 00:02:26,239
the model only handles wording.

45
00:02:26,239 --> 00:02:28,020
Records stay in this browser.

46
00:02:28,803 --> 00:02:31,048
Working today: everything you saw.

47
00:02:31,048 --> 00:02:36,200
Partial: the model's code check isn't airtight; no dose or allergy checks yet.

48
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:40,426
Planned: a validation study, pharmacy import and family sharing.

49
00:02:41,195 --> 00:02:41,725
Kinwise.

50
00:02:41,725 --> 00:02:44,839
Not yet clinician-reviewed; not medical advice.

51
00:02:44,839 --> 00:02:47,555
